WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:01.240
[CLOCK TICKS]

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.520
Does it ever bother you; having to take care of me?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:10.280
Nah. [CANE SLAMS] It makes me feel special.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.080
I'll restore the optical properties of the right eye.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.000
You'll be able to count fingers on day one. By week 4, you should be at 20/50!

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.600
May I have you count backwards from ten?
-Ten...

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.140
Nine...

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.520
Gina?! [DRAMATIC BOOM]

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.280
[SOBS]

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.740
I can see! [BOTH GIGGLE]

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.040
♪ I may not always love you ♪

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.920
♪ Love is in the stars above you ♪

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.520
♪ You'll never need to doubt it ♪

00:00:55.980 --> 00:01:00.420
♪ I'll make you so sure about it ♪ [DRAMATIC BOOM]

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.180
-What's going on?
-I just feel like I know everything... but now I don't.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.120
[CHUCKLE]

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:13.240
Never seen my wife in a dress like that. Guess it's not really you, huh?

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.960
Well, we don't really know who "me" is, do we?

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.360
Who is the guy you were talking over there?

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.960
[GIGGLES]

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:41.160
[THAI WOMAN SPEAKING THROUGH EARBUDS]

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:44.840
[inaudible]

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.260
Did you love me more before?

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:51.940
You were blind?

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.060
I could ask you the same thing.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:17.020
♪

